      "message": "Moving this here means that the handlers registered with the callback never see the busy status set.  [For example](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/subsys/pd_controller/pdc_power_mgmt.c;l\u003d3153;drc\u003d202e8f0423d001721dbc5e82dd3367ba7b1ff25a)\n\nA better fix is to check the retry counter and only send the notification on the first retry.\n\n```\nif (data-\u003eping_retry_counter \u003d\u003d 1) {\n    data-\u003ecci_event.busy \u003d 1;\n    call_cci_event_cb(data);\n}\n```",
